Z||000011||Voytek||07-27-2001||12:50 PM||||Ok, I couldn't refuse.<BR>Triad - the whole 'I'm leaving now' thing does work if you're a girl.  When FieroLisa said she's leaving, I think the whole forum got together and begged her to stay.  The same goes for any other girl on here.<P>That aside, I couldn't care less about people's private relationships when I read PFF.  Fierokid87 - I haven't seen anyone bashing you for saying you love Corinne.  I guess if a lack of other people's enthusiasm makes you feel unwelcome, then so be it.<BR>I suppose if you said you're dating Carmen Electra you'd get a few congratulations.  But then again, that would get old pretty quick too.<P>Most of the time (not always), if I get a reply, it's when someone doesn't like my point of view.  I don't mind that.<P>I'm sure everyone hopes you won't leave for a sissy reason like that.||||reg||1
